{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "013kys_402_2_4_013_02_09_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:f612fc9e9b8e2c14de4d54428234d9ce3218013ab825e79fcdeb74b60201c649",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:013kys_402_2_4_013_02_09_b:2_4_013_02_09_b:cmd-000007:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:68a56efdb8e27918c2c4887d7b87c6ab7d7404eb37ae2ec9721da04aeb29e9bb",
      "text": "啊，●●●●●●●●●●监督？辛苦啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:013kys_402_2_4_013_02_09_b:2_4_013_02_09_b:cmd-000009:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a0e178584c0eec58066cef697cb0d96c2171f1e45a90c01caf0d984c1ec08af9",
      "text": "大概再过30分钟左右就能到演播室了。\n会不会太早了点？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:013kys_402_2_4_013_02_09_b:2_4_013_02_09_b:cmd-000011:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:05f350f2ba7b06a45502d2034e95f4cfa5a4772513dc6d0003e67fa9a7a0be41",
      "text": "已经可以进\n演播室了哦",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:013kys_402_2_4_013_02_09_b:2_4_013_02_09_b:cmd-000012:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8fdf84348a9daac8cb0e65c9077c0d656c411ce87eed0d28d41a10cd1876def8",
      "text": "可以在演播室\n休息",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:013kys_402_2_4_013_02_09_b:2_4_013_02_09_b:cmd-000016:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4ce596a4ada24859f52bdcf562018b95f9583851b9f6ee52acee388003df9f6c",
      "text": "这样啊！既然这样，那我就直接往演播室\n走吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:013kys_402_2_4_013_02_09_b:2_4_013_02_09_b:cmd-000018:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b547a138d3e1ff2a766abb14f39236f8bacf0bd99d163a6c031c11588cc85cc0",
      "text": "那个演播室真的待着很舒服，\n等候的时间也能沉下心来度过呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:013kys_402_2_4_013_02_09_b:2_4_013_02_09_b:cmd-000020:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:82956362a7a5ef98e2571bcb610b0fb17400b00141d17cea176c1f38c9df718e",
      "text": "……只要小心别放松过头，在直播前把头发睡翘了\n就行了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:013kys_402_2_4_013_02_09_b:2_4_013_02_09_b:cmd-000022:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0f7f3d72ac0167f23cf3360808ca31f3a983cf3c453ddbd95336cea7626e3f45",
      "text": "上次是秀先生\n帮忙整理的呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:013kys_402_2_4_013_02_09_b:2_4_013_02_09_b:cmd-000025:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1a4cee2494dfb6ff1e98310cd2151461e2edd0c8e2f551f3e6991c5c302c75fd",
      "text": "啊哈哈……那个也被监督看到了啊。\n我还以为没露馅呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:013kys_402_2_4_013_02_09_b:2_4_013_02_09_b:cmd-000027:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b1abf4ebbca1c8add27b60c067c5bce63d18ca449f5d2622edb5f751e64c9372",
      "text": "虽然正式直播时我打算多加注意、\n不出现奇怪的地方……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:013kys_402_2_4_013_02_09_b:2_4_013_02_09_b:cmd-000029:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b939b9e2cd3bb19c4ab59ed3bdd60bc9aa93a5b8b29859835c7e0c30830c5997",
      "text": "但我觉得，直播中要是能表现得像那天一样放松自如\n给大家看，应该会更好呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:013kys_402_2_4_013_02_09_b:2_4_013_02_09_b:cmd-000031:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d366e694a0670103f0d13f48371da2f5864b75da4d12e6465dbe87703cdad4f0",
      "text": "隔着屏幕把那种氛围传达过去的话，粉丝大家\n也能够放松心情尽情享受吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:013kys_402_2_4_013_02_09_b:2_4_013_02_09_b:cmd-000033:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:014d4746055e4b75559c82ef36871728710f09ab83cbaa2d19ccf5f4c8a12f0a",
      "text": "那我先挂了哦。\n到了车站再跟你联系。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
